WEBVTT

00:04:59.003 --> 00:05:00.171
(Kids laugh)

00:05:00.212 --> 00:05:02.506
And they said, “Daddy,
we’re playing rocket ship.

00:05:02.506 --> 00:05:03.924
Come play with us.”

00:05:03.966 --> 00:05:06.302
It had been a while
since I played with the box,

00:05:06.302 --> 00:05:08.095
but I fired on the engine for them.

00:05:08.137 --> 00:05:09.305
Sure enough,

00:05:09.347 --> 00:05:12.725
after all these years, she still ran
and we headed into space.

00:05:13.225 --> 00:05:15.311
Houston, we're ready for liftoff.

00:05:15.353 --> 00:05:18.272
(Rocket lifts off)

00:05:18.314 --> 00:05:21.734
We ended up going
just a little past Jupiter,

00:05:21.734 --> 00:05:25.237
where we met some friendly space aliens
who taught us a really cool sport

00:05:25.237 --> 00:05:27.698
that I want to show you,
called space soccer.